      "id": "sp_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -294
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Text on a path\n\ntext/on-path lays a line of type along a point spread: here a spiral (spread/spiral) and a ring (spread/ring, closed). Every glyph turns to the path’s tangent. The offset input slides the text along the path over time; glyphs that run off the open spiral’s ends are hidden, the ring wraps around.",
        "width": 460,
        "height": 230
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Text on a path\n\ntext/on-path lays a line of type along a point spread: here a spiral (spread/spiral) and a ring (spread/ring, closed). Every glyph turns to the path’s tangent. The offset input slides the text along the path over time; glyphs that run off the open spiral’s ends are hidden, the ring wraps around.",
